{title: 476 - Burdens Are Lifted at Calvary}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Christian Life}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[F]Days are filled with sor-row and [C7]care,
[C7]Hearts are lonely and [F]drear;
[Bb]Burdens are lifted [F]at Calvary,
[C7]Jesus is [F]very near.

Refrain:
[Bb]Burdens are lifted [F]at Calvary,
[F]Calvary, Calvary,
[Bb]Burdens are lifted [F]at Calvary,
[C7]Jesus is [F]very near.

Verse 2:
[F]Cast your care on Jesus today,
[C7]Leave your worry and [F]fear;
[Bb]Burdens are lifted [F]at Calvary,
[C7]Jesus is [F]very near.

Verse 3:
[F]Troubled soul, the Saviour [Bb/F]can [F]see,
[C7]Ev'ry heartache and [F]tear;
[Bb]Burdens are lifted [F]at Calvary
[C7]Jesus is [F]very near.
